IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sa-part4-repeal-and-amendment`

-- Part 5 of the Legislation Interpretation Act 2021 (South Australia): citation and references (sections 35 and 36).
-- Section 36(2) refers to "replaced (within the meaning of section 33(3))"; that test is the function in the Part 4 module.

§ `Part 5 -- Citation and references (sections 35 and 36)`

§§ `35 -- Citation and references to other enactments`

DECLARE `Way of citing an enactment of this jurisdiction` IS ONE OF
    `its short title`
    `its short title abbreviated by omitting reference to any year except the year in which it was passed`
    `another way of citing`

-- src:429 | (1) An Act or a legislative instrument of this jurisdiction may be cited by—
-- src:430 | (a) its short title; or
-- src:431 | (b) its short title abbreviated by omitting reference to any year except the year in which it was passed.
@ref s 35(1) (src:429-431)
GIVEN way IS A `Way of citing an enactment of this jurisdiction`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`an Act or legislative instrument of this jurisdiction may be cited in this way` MEANS
    CONSIDER way
        WHEN `its short title` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `its short title abbreviated by omitting reference to any year except the year in which it was passed` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `another way of citing` THEN NOTHING

-- src:432 | (2) An Act or a legislative instrument of any other jurisdiction may be cited by its short title or by any method authorised by, or commonly used in, the legislation of that other jurisdiction, together with a reference to the jurisdiction.
@ref s 35(2) (src:432)
GIVEN `it is cited by its short title` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is cited by a method authorised by, or commonly used in, the legislation of that other jurisdiction` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the citation is made together with a reference to the jurisdiction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`an Act or legislative instrument of another jurisdiction may be cited in this way` MEANS
    IF (`it is cited by its short title` OR `it is cited by a method authorised by, or commonly used in, the legislation of that other jurisdiction`)
       AND `the citation is made together with a reference to the jurisdiction`
    THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:433 | (3) A reference in an Act or a legislative instrument to an Act of this or any other jurisdiction includes a reference to legislative instruments made or in force under that Act.
@ref s 35(3) (src:433)
GIVEN `the instrument is made or in force under that Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`a reference to an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` MEANS
    IF `the instrument is made or in force under that Act` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:434 | (4) A reference in an Act or a legislative instrument to a portion or provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction includes a reference to—
-- src:435 | (a) legislative instruments made or in force under that portion or provision of that Act; and
-- src:436 | (b) legislative instruments made or in force under some other portion or provision of that Act that are connected to the portion or provision mentioned in paragraph (a).
@ref s 35(4) (src:434-436)
GIVEN `the instrument is made or in force under that portion or provision of that Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the instrument is made or in force under some other portion or provision of that Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the instrument is connected to the portion or provision mentioned in paragraph (a)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`a reference to a portion or provision of an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` MEANS
    IF `the instrument is made or in force under that portion or provision of that Act`
       OR (`the instrument is made or in force under some other portion or provision of that Act` AND `the instrument is connected to the portion or provision mentioned in paragraph (a)`)
    THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:437 | (5) Nothing in this section renders unlawful or ineffective any citation or reference that is not made in a manner authorised by this section.
@ref s 35(5) (src:437)
`section 35 renders unlawful or ineffective a citation or reference not made in a manner it authorises` MEANS JUST FALSE

§§ `36 -- References to amended or replaced Acts, legislative instruments and provisions`

DECLARE `Thing a reference refers to` IS ONE OF
    `an Act of this or any other jurisdiction`
    `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction`
    `a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction`
    `a provision of a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction`
    `something else a reference refers to`

-- src:439 | (1) This section applies to a reference in an Act or a legislative instrument to—
-- src:440 | (a) an Act, or a provision of an Act, of this or any other jurisdiction; or
-- src:441 | (b) a legislative instrument, or a provision of a legislative instrument, of this or any other jurisdiction.
@ref s 36(1) (src:439-441)
GIVEN thing IS A `Thing a reference refers to`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 36 applies to a reference to` MEANS
    CONSIDER thing
        WHEN `an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` THEN TRUE
        WHEN `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` THEN TRUE
        WHEN `a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction` THEN TRUE
        WHEN `a provision of a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction` THEN TRUE
        WHEN `something else a reference refers to` THEN FALSE

-- src:442 | (2) The reference is a reference to that Act, legislative instrument or provision as amended from time to time and, if it is replaced (within the meaning of section 33(3)), as replaced and amended from time to time.
@ref s 36(2) (src:442)
GIVEN thing IS A `Thing a reference refers to`
      `it has been repealed or superseded by a later Act, instrument or provision` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the later one deals with the same matter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the reference is a reference to the enactment as replaced and amended from time to time` MEANS
    IF NOT (`section 36 applies to a reference to` thing) THEN NOTHING
    ELSE (IF `an Act, instrument or provision is taken to have been replaced` `it has been repealed or superseded by a later Act, instrument or provision` `the later one deals with the same matter` = JUST TRUE
          THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)

-- src:442 | (2) The reference is a reference to that Act, legislative instrument or provision as amended from time to time and, if it is replaced (within the meaning of section 33(3)), as replaced and amended from time to time.
@ref s 36(2) (src:442)
GIVEN thing IS A `Thing a reference refers to`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the reference is a reference to the enactment as amended from time to time` MEANS
    IF `section 36 applies to a reference to` thing THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

§§ `Tests`

#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of this jurisdiction may be cited in this way` `its short title` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of this jurisdiction may be cited in this way` `its short title abbreviated by omitting reference to any year except the year in which it was passed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of this jurisdiction may be cited in this way` `another way of citing` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of another jurisdiction may be cited in this way` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of another jurisdiction may be cited in this way` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of another jurisdiction may be cited in this way` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `an Act or legislative instrument of another jurisdiction may be cited in this way` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a reference to an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a reference to an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a reference to a portion or provision of an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a reference to a portion or provision of an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a reference to a portion or provision of an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a reference to a portion or provision of an Act includes a reference to the legislative instrument` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `section 35 renders unlawful or ineffective a citation or reference not made in a manner it authorises` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `section 36 applies to a reference to` `an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `section 36 applies to a reference to` `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `section 36 applies to a reference to` `a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `section 36 applies to a reference to` `a provision of a legislative instrument of this or any other jurisdiction` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `section 36 applies to a reference to` `something else a reference refers to` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as amended from time to time` `an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as amended from time to time` `something else a reference refers to` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as replaced and amended from time to time` `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as replaced and amended from time to time` `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as replaced and amended from time to time` `a provision of an Act of this or any other jurisdiction` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the reference is a reference to the enactment as replaced and amended from time to time` `something else a reference refers to` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
